---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About — SYRIMO" description="Syah builds technology that makes lives better — for education, community, and the preservation of knowledge.">
  <Header />

  <main class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-6 pt-28 pb-16">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <img
        src="/og/default.png"
        alt="Syah"
        class="w-full rounded-xl mb-10"
        loading="eager"
      />

      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6">
        I build things and write about why.
      </h1>

      <div class="prose max-w-none">
        <p>
          I'm Syah — founder of <a href="https://suterahijau.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Sutera Hijau Academy</a>, a technology studio based in Cyberjaya, Malaysia. Since 2017, I've been building products for education, community finance, and Islamic content — quietly, intentionally, and with real users in mind.
        </p>

        <p>
          I created <strong>Nurflix</strong> to bring the stories of the Prophets and Companions to a new generation — reaching 40,000 viewers and 50,000 followers. Then <strong>Nurcast</strong>, exploring the Quran through podcast. The costs were real, but the lessons were worth more. Now I'm rebuilding smarter, powered by AI.
        </p>

        <p>
          Today I run <strong>ORCA</strong> — an AI operations layer that builds, deploys, and operates software systems. With it, I've shipped products across education, fintech, and content delivery. One person. Real impact.
        </p>

        <h2>What this blog is about</h2>

        <p>
          Every day, an AI agent crawls curated sources across seven categories — technology, business, current affairs, science, Islamic civilisation, history, and the human mind. It finds what matters, and I write about it with depth, critical thinking, and a perspective shaped by building real things.
        </p>

        <p>
          This isn't a neutral space. I believe technology should serve people, not extract from them. I believe clarity of purpose beats scale. And I believe the generation described in Surah Al-Fath — committed, principled, unshakeable — is the model worth following.
        </p>

        <h2>Connect</h2>

        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://x.com/syrimo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">X / Twitter</a></li>
          <li><a href="https://github.com/syrimo" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a></li>
          <li><a href="mailto:syah@suterahijau.com">syah@suterahijau.com</a></li>
          <li><a href="/rss.xml">RSS Feed</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
